pcf version=2
* control data keyword
pestmode                                 estimation
noptmax                                 3
svdmode                                 1
maxsing                          10000000
eigthresh                           1e-06
eigwrite                                1
forecasts                      oname:sfr_otype:lst_usecol:tailwater_time:4383.5,oname:sfr_otype:lst_usecol:headwater_time:4383.5,oname:hds_otype:lst_usecol:trgw-0-9-1_time:4383.5,part_time
ies_num_reals                  300
ies_parameter_ensemble         prior_pe.jcb
ies_bad_phi_sigma              2.0
overdue_giveup_fac             1e+30
overdue_giveup_minutes         1e+30
save_binary                    true
* parameter groups external
pest.pargp_data.csv
* parameter data external
pest.par_data.csv
* observation data external
pest.obs_data.csv
* model command line
python forward_run.py
* model input external
pest.tplfile_data.csv
* model output external
pest.insfile_data.csv
